{title: Bhula Dunga}
{artist: Darshan Raval}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Ik pal me tum ko,        [A#] mai bhula du [G#] nga
Dil [Cm] todne ki [A#] ye saza du [G#] nga,        [Cm] Ik pal me tum ko
[A#] mai bhula du [G#] nga,        Dil [Cm] todne ki [A#] ye saza du [G#] nga
Meri [Cm] yaado ke,        mau [A#] sam jo tum cha [Fm] aye
Chaahe [G#] jitna tum,        cha [A#] ahoge par na aa [Cm] yenge
Tum [G#] se durr [A#] hum itna,        ho [Cm] jaayenge
[Cm] Lamha-lamha [A#] tere bin,        [G#] jiya na jaye [A#] rey
[Cm] Dekhu har [A#] jagah me bs,        [G#] tere he saaye [A#] re
Me toota hua [Cm] saaz hun [G#],        Tu meri [Fm] awaaz tha [A#]
Likhi thi jahaan [Cm] zindagi [G#],        Tu meri [Fm] kitab tha [A#]
Abb [G#] na fikr,        [A#] karna hum jee [Cm] jaayenge
Is [G#] dard ko,        [A#] dheere dheere pi [Cm] jaayenge
Chaahe [G#] jitna tum cha [A#] ahoge,        par na aa [Cm] yenge
[G#] Tumse durr [A#] hum itna,        [Cm] ho jaayenge
